  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Stable Release:\n\t\t\t- Launched ModernDataGridView for WinForms (net472, net48, net6.0, net8.0).\n\t\t\t- Added hardware-accelerated GDI+ rendering engine (Zero flickering).\n\t\t\t- Built-in Pagination and Virtual Mode (tested with 1,000,000+ rows).\n\t\t\t- In-cell analytics: DataBars and Vector Sparklines.\n\t\t\t- Rule-based conditional formatting and master-detail row expansion.\n\t\t\t- Built-in Zero-Dependency Data Export (PDF, CSV, JSON, XML).\n\t\t\t- Integrated 5 premium design styles with native Dark and Light mode support.",
